#: ../../modules/core/core_terms_maps_comparisons.rst:39
msgid ""
"Construction *canonicalizes* the expression (flattening nested "
"sums/products, combining like terms and powers, folding constants, "
"ordering operands deterministically), which is why the numeric constant "
"is printed first and ``x + y`` equals ``y + x``. Canonicalization is "
"intentionally cheap: products are **not** distributed over sums, so "
"``e4`` keeps the factored ``- (4 + 2 * x + 3 * x**2)`` sub-expression. "
"Use :meth:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression.expand` to distribute, and"
" :meth:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression.simplify` to request a "
"simpler (but semantically equal) form:"
msgstr ""
"La construcció *canonitza* l'expressió (aplanant sumes i productes "
"imbricats, combinant termes i potències semblants, plegant constants i "
"ordenant els operands de manera determinista), i per això la constant "
"numèrica s'imprimeix primer i ``x + y`` és igual a ``y + x``. La "
"canonització és deliberadament barata: els productes **no** es "
"distribueixen sobre les sumes, així que ``e4`` conserva la subexpressió "
"factoritzada ``- (4 + 2 * x + 3 * x**2)``. Utilitzeu "
":meth:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression.expand` per distribuir i "
":meth:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression.simplify` per demanar una forma "
"més simple (però semànticament igual):"

#: ../../modules/core/core_terms_maps_comparisons.rst:56
msgid ""
"Expressions can be evaluated by providing values for the involved "
"variables via :meth:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression.evaluate`:"
msgstr ""
"Les expressions es poden avaluar proporcionant valors per a les variables "
"implicades mitjançant "
":meth:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression.evaluate`:"

#: ../../modules/core/core_terms_maps_comparisons.rst:74
msgid ""
"To evaluate an expression, all participating variables must be assigned "
"valid values within their respective domains and bounds."
msgstr ""
"Per avaluar una expressió, a totes les variables participants se'ls han "
"d'assignar valors vàlids dins dels seus dominis i límits respectius."

#: ../../modules/core/core_terms_maps_comparisons.rst:77
msgid "Inspecting and differentiating expressions"
msgstr "Inspeccionar i derivar expressions"

#: ../../modules/core/core_terms_maps_comparisons.rst:79
msgid ""
"An :class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression` exposes a small "
"introspection API. You can list the named leaves it depends on, isolate "
"just the free :class:`~qilisdk.core.variables.Parameter` leaves, read its"
" polynomial :attr:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression.degree`, and take "
"a symbolic derivative with "
":meth:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression.diff`:"
msgstr ""
"Una :class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression` exposa una petita API "
"d'introspecció. Podeu llistar les fulles amb nom de les quals depèn, "
"aïllar únicament les fulles :class:`~qilisdk.core.variables.Parameter` "
"lliures, llegir el seu :attr:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression.degree` "
"polinòmic i calcular una derivada simbòlica amb "
":meth:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression.diff`:"

#: ../../modules/core/core_terms_maps_comparisons.rst:109
msgid "Mathematical Functions"
msgstr "Funcions matemàtiques"

#: ../../modules/core/core_terms_maps_comparisons.rst:111
msgid ""
"Non-polynomial operations are represented by "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Function`, the abstract base for the "
"unary maths functions. Its concrete subclasses "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Sin`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Cos`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Exp`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Log`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Tan`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Sqrt` and "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Abs` each wrap a single "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression` operand (a "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.variables.Parameter`, any other variable, or a "
"compound expression) and defer numeric evaluation until values are "
"provided."
msgstr ""
"Les operacions no polinòmiques es representen amb "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Function`, la base abstracta de les "
"funcions matemàtiques unàries. Les seves subclasses concretes "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Sin`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Cos`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Exp`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Log`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Tan`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Sqrt` i "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Abs` embolcallen cadascuna un únic "
"operand :class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Expression` (un "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.variables.Parameter`, qualsevol altra variable o una "
"expressió composta) i ajornen l'avaluació numèrica fins que es "
"proporcionen valors."

#: ../../modules/core/core_terms_maps_comparisons.rst:142
msgid ""
"Because every function is a regular ``Expression`` node, it participates "
"in the same algebra: it can be added to or multiplied with other "
"expressions, differentiated symbolically (the chain rule is applied "
"automatically), and evaluated. Wrapping a numeric constant folds eagerly "
"to a :class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Constant`:"
msgstr ""
"Com que cada funció és un node ``Expression`` normal, participa en la "
"mateixa àlgebra: es pot sumar o multiplicar amb altres expressions, "
"derivar simbòlicament (la regla de la cadena s'aplica automàticament) i "
"avaluar. Embolcallar una constant numèrica es plega immediatament a una "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.expression.Constant`:"

#: ../../modules/core/core_terms_maps_comparisons.rst:166
msgid ""
"These functions compose naturally with the rest of the expression tree, "
"so you can include them in constraints, objectives, or schedule "
"coefficients and rely on the same evaluation and encoding rules as any "
"other symbolic expression."
msgstr ""
"Aquestes funcions es componen de manera natural amb la resta de l'arbre "
"d'expressions, de manera que les podeu incloure en restriccions, objectius "
"o coeficients de schedules i es regeixen per les mateixes regles "
"d'avaluació i codificació que qualsevol altra expressió simbòlica."

